\h Malachi
\toc1 Malachi
\p
\rem From here on, this file is autogenerated by bibmark. You may edit the header section, as it will not be changed by bibmark.

\c 1
\p 
\v 1 \w The burden| strong="H4853" \w* \w of the word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w to Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w by| strong="H3027" \w* \w Malachi| strong="H4401" \w*.\f + \fr 1:1 \ft by…: Heb. by the hand of \f* 
\v 2 [I have loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [you, saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*. [Yet ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Wherein hast thou loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} us? Was \w not Esau| strong="H6215" \w* [Jacob’s]{strong=“H3290”} \w brother| strong="H251" \w*? [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*: [yet I loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, 
\v 3 [And I hated]{strong=“H8130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Esau| strong="H6215" \w*, [and laid]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his mountains| strong="H2022" \w* \w and his heritage| strong="H5159" \w* \w waste| strong="H8077" \w* \w for the dragons| strong="H8568" \w* \w of the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w*. 
\v 4 \w Whereas Edom| strong="H123" \w* [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [We are impoverished]{strong=“H7567” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”}, [but we will return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the desolate places| strong="H2723" \w*; [thus saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, [They shall build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [but I will throw down]{strong=“H2040” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [and they shall call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [them, The border]{strong=“H1366”} \w of wickedness| strong="H7564" \w*, [and, The people]{strong=“H5971”} against whom the \sc Lord\sc* [hath indignation]{strong=“H2194” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w for| strong="H5704" \w* \w ever| strong="H5769" \w*. 
\v 5 \w And your eyes| strong="H5869" \w* [shall see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and ye shall say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, The \sc Lord\sc* [will be magnified]{strong=“H1431” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from the border| strong="H1366" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*.\f + \fr 1:5 \ft from: or, upon: Heb. from upon \f* 
\p
\v 6 \w A son| strong="H1121" \w* [honoureth]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} his \w father| strong="H1" \w*, \w and a servant| strong="H5650" \w* \w his master| strong="H113" \w*: if then I be \w a father| strong="H1" \w*, where is \w mine honour| strong="H3519" \w*? and if I be \w a master| strong="H113" \w*, where is \w my fear| strong="H4172" \w*? [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w* [unto you, O priests]{strong=“H3548”}, [that despise]{strong=“H959” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w my name| strong="H8034" \w*. [And ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Wherein have we despised]{strong=“H959” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thy name| strong="H8034" \w*? 
\v 7 [Ye offer]{strong=“H5066” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} [polluted]{strong=“H1351” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”} \w bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w upon mine altar| strong="H4196" \w*; [and ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Wherein have we polluted]{strong=“H1351” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [thee? In that ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w The table| strong="H7979" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* is [contemptible]{strong=“H959” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}.\f + \fr 1:7 \ft offer…: or, bring unto, etc \f* 
\v 8 [And if ye offer]{strong=“H5066” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the blind| strong="H5787" \w* [for sacrifice]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, is it \w not evil| strong="H7451" \w*? [and if ye offer]{strong=“H5066” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the lame| strong="H6455" \w* [and sick]{strong=“H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, is it \w not evil| strong="H7451" \w*? [offer]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w it now unto thy governor| strong="H6346" \w*; [will he be pleased]{strong=“H7521” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [with thee, or accept]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy person| strong="H6440" \w*? [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*.\f + \fr 1:8 \ft for: Heb. to \f* 
\v 9 [And now, I pray you, beseech]{strong=“H6440 H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} \w God| strong="H410" \w* [that he will be gracious]{strong=“H2603” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto us: this hath been by your means]{strong=“H3027”}: [will he regard]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w your persons| strong="H6440" \w*? [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*.\f + \fr 1:9 \ft God: Heb. the face of God \f* \f + \fr 1:9 \ft by…: Heb. from your hand \f* 
\v 10 Who is there [even among you that would shut]{strong=“H5462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the doors| strong="H1817" \w* for nought? [neither do ye kindle]{strong=“H215” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} fire \w on mine altar| strong="H4196" \w* \w for nought| strong="H2600" \w*. \w I have no pleasure| strong="H2656" \w* [in you, saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, [neither will I accept]{strong=“H7521” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w an offering| strong="H4503" \w* \w at your hand| strong="H3027" \w*. 
\v 11 \w For from the rising| strong="H4217" \w* \w of the sun| strong="H8121" \w* \w even unto the going down| strong="H3996" \w* \w of the same my name| strong="H8034" \w* shall be \w great| strong="H1419" \w* \w among the Gentiles| strong="H1471" \w*; \w and in every place| strong="H4725" \w* [incense]{strong=“H6999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8716”} shall be [offered]{strong=“H5066” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8716”} \w unto my name| strong="H8034" \w*, \w and a pure| strong="H2889" \w* \w offering| strong="H4503" \w*: \w for my name| strong="H8034" \w* shall be \w great| strong="H1419" \w* \w among the heathen| strong="H1471" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*. 
\p
\v 12 [But ye have profaned]{strong=“H2490” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} [it, in that ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w The table| strong="H7979" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* is [polluted]{strong=“H1351” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}; \w and the fruit| strong="H5108" \w* thereof, even \w his meat| strong="H400" \w*, is [contemptible]{strong=“H959” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}. 
\v 13 [Ye said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [also, Behold, what a weariness]{strong=“H4972”} is it! [and ye have snuffed]{strong=“H5301” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [at it, saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*; [and ye brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} that which was [torn]{strong=“H1497” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}, \w and the lame| strong="H6455" \w*, [and the sick]{strong=“H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}; [thus ye brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w an offering| strong="H4503" \w*: [should I accept]{strong=“H7521” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w this of your hand| strong="H3027" \w*? [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*.\f + \fr 1:13 \ft and ye have…: or, whereas ye might have blown it away \f* 
\v 14 [But cursed]{strong=“H779” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} be [the deceiver]{strong=“H5230” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w which| strong="H3426" \w* \w hath in his flock| strong="H5739" \w* \w a male| strong="H2145" \w*, [and voweth]{strong=“H5087” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [and sacrificeth]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w unto the Lord| strong="H136" \w* [a corrupt thing]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8716”}: for I am \w a great| strong="H1419" \w* \w King| strong="H4428" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, \w and my name| strong="H8034" \w* is [dreadful]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w among the heathen| strong="H1471" \w*.\f + \fr 1:14 \ft which…: Heb. in whose flock is \f*
\c 2
\p 
\v 1 [And now, O ye priests]{strong=“H3548”}, \w this commandment| strong="H4687" \w* is for you. 
\v 2 [If ye will not hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and if ye will not lay]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it \w to heart| strong="H3820" \w*, [to give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w glory| strong="H3519" \w* \w unto my name| strong="H8034" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, [I will even send]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w a curse| strong="H3994" \w* [upon you, and I will curse]{strong=“H779” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w your blessings| strong="H1293" \w*: [yea, I have cursed]{strong=“H779” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [them already, because ye do not lay]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} it \w to heart| strong="H3820" \w*. 
\v 3 [Behold, I will corrupt]{strong=“H1605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w your seed| strong="H2233" \w*, [and spread]{strong=“H2219” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w dung| strong="H6569" \w* \w upon your faces| strong="H6440" \w*, even \w the dung| strong="H6569" \w* \w of your solemn feasts| strong="H2282" \w*; and one [shall take you away]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} with it.\f + \fr 2:3 \ft corrupt: or, reprove \f* \f + \fr 2:3 \ft spread: Heb. scatter \f* \f + \fr 2:3 \ft one…: or, it shall take you away to it \f* 
\v 4 [And ye shall know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [that I have sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w this commandment| strong="H4687" \w* [unto you, that my covenant]{strong=“H1285”} \w might be with Levi| strong="H3878" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*. 
\v 5 \w My covenant| strong="H1285" \w* \w was with him of life| strong="H2416" \w* \w and peace| strong="H7965" \w*; [and I gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} them to him for \w the fear| strong="H4172" \w* [wherewith he feared]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [me, and was afraid]{strong=“H2865” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w my name| strong="H8034" \w*. 
\v 6 \w The law| strong="H8451" \w* \w of truth| strong="H571" \w* \w was in his mouth| strong="H6310" \w*, \w and iniquity| strong="H5766" \w* [was not found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w in his lips| strong="H8193" \w*: [he walked]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with me in peace| strong="H7965" \w* \w and equity| strong="H4334" \w*, \w and did turn| strong="H7725" \w* \w many| strong="H7227" \w* [away]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w from iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*. 
\v 7 [For the priest’s]{strong=“H3548”} \w lips| strong="H8193" \w* [should keep]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w knowledge| strong="H1847" \w*, [and they should seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the law| strong="H8451" \w* \w at his mouth| strong="H6310" \w*: for he is \w the messenger| strong="H4397" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*. 
\v 8 [But ye are departed]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w out of the way| strong="H1870" \w*; \w ye have caused many| strong="H7227" \w* [to stumble]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w at the law| strong="H8451" \w*; [ye have corrupted]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w the covenant| strong="H1285" \w* \w of Levi| strong="H3878" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*.\f + \fr 2:8 \ft stumble at: or, fall in \f* 
\v 9 [Therefore have I also made]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [you contemptible]{strong=“H959” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w and base| strong="H8217" \w* \w before all the people| strong="H5971" \w*, \w according| strong="H6310" \w* [as ye have not kept]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w my ways| strong="H1870" \w*, [but have been partial]{strong=“H6440 H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the law| strong="H8451" \w*.\f + \fr 2:9 \ft have been…: or, lifted up the face against: Heb. accepted faces \f* 
\p
\v 10 \w Have we not all one| strong="H259" \w* \w father| strong="H1" \w*? \w hath not one| strong="H259" \w* \w God| strong="H410" \w* [created]{strong=“H1254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [us? why do we deal treacherously]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w every man| strong="H376" \w* \w against his brother| strong="H251" \w*, [by profaning]{strong=“H2490” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w the covenant| strong="H1285" \w* \w of our fathers| strong="H1" \w*? 
\p
\v 11 \w Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [hath dealt treacherously]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and an abomination| strong="H8441" \w* [is committed]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w and in Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*; \w for Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [hath profaned]{strong=“H2490” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w the holiness| strong="H6944" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [which he loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and hath married]{strong=“H1166” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of a strange| strong="H5236" \w* \w god| strong="H410" \w*.\f + \fr 2:11 \ft loved: or, ought to love \f* 
\v 12 The \sc Lord\sc* [will cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the man| strong="H376" \w* [that doeth]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [this, the master]{strong=“H5782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [and the scholar]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w out of the tabernacles| strong="H168" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, [and him that offereth]{strong=“H5066” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w an offering| strong="H4503" \w* unto the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*.\f + \fr 2:12 \ft the master…: or, him that waketh, and him that answereth \f* 
\v 13 [And this have ye done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w again| strong="H8145" \w*, [covering]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w the altar| strong="H4196" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w with tears| strong="H1832" \w*, \w with weeping| strong="H1065" \w*, \w and with crying out| strong="H603" \w*, [insomuch that he regardeth]{strong=“H6437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w not the offering| strong="H4503" \w* [any more, or receiveth]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} it \w with good will| strong="H7522" \w* \w at your hand| strong="H3027" \w*. 
\p
\v 14 [Yet ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w Wherefore| strong="H4100" \w*? Because the \sc Lord\sc* [hath been witness]{strong=“H5749” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w between thee and the wife| strong="H802" \w* \w of thy youth| strong="H5271" \w*, [against whom thou hast dealt treacherously]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: yet is \w she thy companion| strong="H2278" \w*, \w and the wife| strong="H802" \w* \w of thy covenant| strong="H1285" \w*. 
\v 15 [And did not he make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w one| strong="H259" \w*? \w Yet had he the residue| strong="H7605" \w* \w of the spirit| strong="H7307" \w*. \w And wherefore one| strong="H259" \w*? [That he might seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w a godly| strong="H430" \w* \w seed| strong="H2233" \w*. [Therefore take heed]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w to your spirit| strong="H7307" \w*, [and let none deal treacherously]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w against the wife| strong="H802" \w* \w of his youth| strong="H5271" \w*.\f + \fr 2:15 \ft residue: or, excellency \f* \f + \fr 2:15 \ft godly…: Heb. seed of God \f* \f + \fr 2:15 \ft treacherously: or, unfaithfully \f* 
\v 16 For the \sc Lord\sc*, \w the God| strong="H430" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [that he hateth]{strong=“H8130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [putting away]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”}: for one [covereth]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w violence| strong="H2555" \w* \w with his garment| strong="H3830" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*: [therefore take heed]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w to your spirit| strong="H7307" \w*, [that ye deal not treacherously]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 2:16 \ft that he…: or, if he hate her, put her away \f* \f + \fr 2:16 \ft putting…: Heb. to put away \f* 
\p
\v 17 [Ye have wearied]{strong=“H3021” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w with your words| strong="H1697" \w*. [Yet ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Wherein have we wearied]{strong=“H3021” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} him? [When ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [Every one that doeth]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w evil| strong="H7451" \w* is \w good| strong="H2896" \w* \w in the sight| strong="H5869" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, [and he delighteth]{strong=“H2654” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} in them; or, Where is \w the God| strong="H430" \w* \w of judgment| strong="H4941" \w*? 
\c 3
\p 
\v 1 [Behold, I will send]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w my messenger| strong="H4397" \w*, [and he shall prepare]{strong=“H6437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w the way| strong="H1870" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [me: and the Lord]{strong=“H113”}, [whom ye seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, \w shall suddenly| strong="H6597" \w* [come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to his temple| strong="H1964" \w*, \w even the messenger| strong="H4397" \w* \w of the covenant| strong="H1285" \w*, \w whom ye delight| strong="H2655" \w* [in: behold, he shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*. 
\v 2 [But who may abide]{strong=“H3557” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8772”} \w the day| strong="H3117" \w* [of his coming]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}? [and who shall stand]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [when he appeareth]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8736”}? for he is [like a refiner’s]{strong=“H6884” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w fire| strong="H784" \w*, [and like fullers’]{strong=“H3526” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w soap| strong="H1287" \w*: 
\v 3 [And he shall sit]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} as [a refiner]{strong=“H6884” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} [and purifier]{strong=“H2891” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w*: [and he shall purify]{strong=“H2891” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w the sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Levi| strong="H3878" \w*, [and purge]{strong=“H2212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w them as gold| strong="H2091" \w* \w and silver| strong="H3701" \w*, [that they may offer]{strong=“H5066” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} unto the \sc Lord\sc* \w an offering| strong="H4503" \w* \w in righteousness| strong="H6666" \w*. 
\v 4 \w Then shall the offering| strong="H4503" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w* \w and Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w* [be pleasant]{strong=“H6149” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*, \w as in the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of old| strong="H5769" \w*, \w and as in former| strong="H6931" \w* \w years| strong="H8141" \w*.\f + \fr 3:4 \ft former: or, ancient \f* 
\v 5 [And I will come near]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to you to judgment| strong="H4941" \w*; [and I will be a swift]{strong=“H4116” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w witness| strong="H5707" \w* [against the sorcerers]{strong=“H3784” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, [and against the adulterers]{strong=“H5003” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, \w and against false| strong="H8267" \w* [swearers]{strong=“H7650” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}, [and against those that oppress]{strong=“H6231” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the hireling| strong="H7916" \w* in his \w wages| strong="H7939" \w*, \w the widow| strong="H490" \w*, \w and the fatherless| strong="H3490" \w*, [and that turn aside]{strong=“H5186” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w the stranger| strong="H1616" \w* from his right, [and fear]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not me, saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*.\f + \fr 3:5 \ft oppress: or, defraud \f* 
\v 6 For I am the \sc Lord\sc*, [I change]{strong=“H8138” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not; therefore ye sons]{strong=“H1121”} \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* [are not consumed]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}. 
\p
\v 7 \w Even from the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of your fathers| strong="H1" \w* [ye are gone away]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w from mine ordinances| strong="H2706" \w*, [and have not kept]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} them. [Return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [unto me, and I will return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto you, saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*. [But ye said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Wherein shall we return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}? 
\p
\v 8 \w Will a man| strong="H120" \w* [rob]{strong=“H6906” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w God| strong="H430" \w*? [Yet ye have robbed]{strong=“H6906” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [me. But ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Wherein have we robbed]{strong=“H6906” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [thee? In tithes]{strong=“H4643”} \w and offerings| strong="H8641" \w*. 
\v 9 Ye are [cursed]{strong=“H779” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w with a curse| strong="H3994" \w*: [for ye have robbed]{strong=“H6906” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} me, even \w this whole nation| strong="H1471" \w*. 
\v 10 [Bring]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w ye all the tithes| strong="H4643" \w* \w into the storehouse| strong="H214" \w*, \w that there may be meat| strong="H2964" \w* \w in mine house| strong="H1004" \w*, [and prove]{strong=“H974” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w me now herewith| strong="H2063" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, [if I will not open]{strong=“H6605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w you the windows| strong="H699" \w* \w of heaven| strong="H8064" \w*, [and pour you out]{strong=“H7324” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w a blessing| strong="H1293" \w*, that there shall not be room \w enough| strong="H1767" \w* to receive it.\f + \fr 3:10 \ft pour…: Heb. empty out \f* 
\v 11 [And I will rebuke]{strong=“H1605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [the devourer]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [for your sakes, and he shall not destroy]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the fruits| strong="H6529" \w* \w of your ground| strong="H127" \w*; \w neither shall your vine| strong="H1612" \w* [cast her fruit]{strong=“H7921” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w before the time in the field| strong="H7704" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*.\f + \fr 3:11 \ft destroy: Heb. corrupt \f* 
\v 12 \w And all nations| strong="H1471" \w* [shall call you blessed]{strong=“H833” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”}: \w for ye shall be a delightsome| strong="H2656" \w* \w land| strong="H776" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*. 
\p
\v 13 \w Your words| strong="H1697" \w* [have been stout]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [against me, saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*. [Yet ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [What have we spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} so much against thee? 
\v 14 [Ye have said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, It is \w vain| strong="H7723" \w* [to serve]{strong=“H5647” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w God| strong="H430" \w*: \w and what profit| strong="H1215" \w* is it [that we have kept]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w his ordinance| strong="H4931" \w*, [and that we have walked]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w mournfully| strong="H6941" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*?\f + \fr 3:14 \ft ordinance: Heb. observation \f* \f + \fr 3:14 \ft mournfully: Heb. in black \f* 
\v 15 \w And now we call| strong="H833" \w* \w the proud| strong="H2086" \w* [happy]{strong=“H833” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}; [yea, they that work]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w wickedness| strong="H7564" \w* [are set up]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}; yea, they that [tempt]{strong=“H974” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w God| strong="H430" \w* [are even delivered]{strong=“H4422” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}.\f + \fr 3:15 \ft are set up: Heb. are built \f* 
\p
\v 16 \w Then they that feared| strong="H3373" \w* the \sc Lord\sc* [spake often]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w one| strong="H376" \w* \w to another| strong="H7453" \w*: and the \sc Lord\sc* [hearkened]{strong=“H7181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [and heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it, \w and a book| strong="H5612" \w* \w of remembrance| strong="H2146" \w* [was written]{strong=“H3789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w him for them that feared| strong="H3373" \w* the \sc Lord\sc*, [and that thought]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w upon his name| strong="H8034" \w*. 
\v 17 [And they shall be mine, saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, \w in that day| strong="H3117" \w* [when I make up]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w my jewels| strong="H5459" \w*; [and I will spare]{strong=“H2550” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [them, as a man]{strong=“H376”} [spareth ]{strong=“H2550” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his own son| strong="H1121" \w* [that serveth]{strong=“H5647” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} him.\f + \fr 3:17 \ft jewels: or, special treasure \f* 
\v 18 [Then shall ye return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and discern]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w between the righteous| strong="H6662" \w* \w and the wicked| strong="H7563" \w*, [between him that serveth]{strong=“H5647” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w God| strong="H430" \w* [and him that serveth]{strong=“H5647” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} him not.
\c 4
\p 
\v 1 [For, behold, the day]{strong=“H3117”} [cometh]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [that shall burn]{strong=“H1197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w as an oven| strong="H8574" \w*; \w and all the proud| strong="H2086" \w*, [yea, and all that do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w wickedly| strong="H7564" \w*, \w shall be stubble| strong="H7179" \w*: \w and the day| strong="H3117" \w* [that cometh]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall burn them up]{strong=“H3857” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”}, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, [that it shall leave]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them neither root| strong="H8328" \w* \w nor branch| strong="H6057" \w*. 
\p
\v 2 \w But unto you that fear| strong="H3373" \w* \w my name| strong="H8034" \w* \w shall the Sun| strong="H8121" \w* \w of righteousness| strong="H6666" \w* [arise ]{strong=“H2224” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with healing| strong="H4832" \w* \w in his wings| strong="H3671" \w*; [and ye shall go forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and grow up]{strong=“H6335” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w as calves| strong="H5695" \w* \w of the stall| strong="H4770" \w*. 
\v 3 [And ye shall tread down]{strong=“H6072” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the wicked| strong="H7563" \w*; \w for they shall be ashes| strong="H665" \w* \w under the soles| strong="H3709" \w* \w of your feet| strong="H7272" \w* \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* [that I shall do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} this, [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*. 
\p
\v 4 [Remember]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w ye the law| strong="H8451" \w* \w of Moses| strong="H4872" \w* \w my servant| strong="H5650" \w*, [which I commanded]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w unto him in Horeb| strong="H2722" \w* \w for all Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, with \w the statutes| strong="H2706" \w* \w and judgments| strong="H4941" \w*. 
\p
\v 5 [Behold, I will send]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w you Elijah| strong="H452" \w* \w the prophet| strong="H5030" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [the coming]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w of the great| strong="H1419" \w* [and dreadful]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w day| strong="H3117" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*: 
\v 6 [And he shall turn]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the heart| strong="H3820" \w* \w of the fathers| strong="H1" \w* \w to the children| strong="H1121" \w*, \w and the heart| strong="H3820" \w* \w of the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w to their fathers| strong="H1" \w*, [lest I come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and smite]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the earth| strong="H776" \w* \w with a curse| strong="H2764" \w*. 